<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust sets warrants on CITIC.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on CITIC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said it has launched 65 million American-style call warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$37.43    PREMIUM	  14.55 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.7703   GEARING	  5.12x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	24.FEB.98   PAYDATE	  2,3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG   EXER LOT	 10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT  HK$39.40    GOVERNING LAW  HONG KONG</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	PHYSICAL SHARES WITH CASH ALTERNATIVE AT</p>
<p> DISCRETION OF THE ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
